{"availability":"available","full":"Daniel-Ziv/toplaptop.net","name":"toplaptop.net","description":" Designed a fully functional public website using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to assist non-technical users in finding the ideal laptop through a custom algorithm.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":9,"forks":3,"created":"2024-10-10T09:33:50Z","updated":"2024-10-24T11:27:51Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://toplaptop.net","topics":[],"demo":"https://toplaptop.net/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T05:11:35.432Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T05:11:35.432Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T05:11:35.432Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:37:49.611Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:18:34.368Z","stars":9,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-04T05:49:00.259Z","stars":9,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-05T05:11:35.432Z","stars":9,"forks":3}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This project is a Laptop Recommendation System that helps users find the best laptop based on their specific needs and preferences, including tasks like web browsing, gaming, photo editing, programming, and more. The system uses weights for different laptop parameters (RAM, CPU, screen refresh rate, storage type, etc.) to calculate the best-suited laptops for users, considering factors such as budget, portability, and screen size preferences."],"features":["Dynamic Task-Based Weighting: Users can select tasks like gaming, video editing, or programming, and the system dynamically adjusts weights to prioritize laptops based on these needs.","Price and Budget Filtering: The system considers the user's budget to recommend laptops within their price range.","Real-Time Scoring: Each laptop is scored based on how well it matches the user's selected criteria, and the top recommendations are displayed.","Responsive Design: The recommendation system is fully responsive and works on all screen sizes."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Daniel-Ziv/toplaptop.net/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ff8e6d99e0b19077244a019fbf99ef4c10e359a4eaa1c1b629af16d7cd1705c3","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T05:59:37.176Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:13:24.520Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2024-10-24T11:27:51Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This project is a Laptop Recommendation System that helps users find the best laptop based on their specific needs and preferences, including tasks like web browsing, gaming, photo editing, programming, and more. The system uses weights for different laptop parameters (RAM, CPU, screen refresh rate, storage type, etc.) to calculate the best-suited laptops for users, considering factors such as budget, portability, and screen size preferences.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Daniel-Ziv/toplaptop.net/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"ff8e6d99e0b19077244a019fbf99ef4c10e359a4eaa1c1b629af16d7cd1705c3","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Daniel-Ziv/toplaptop.net/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T08:13:24.520Z"},"overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T08:13:23.792Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Daniel-Ziv/toplaptop.net/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T08:13:24.520Z","hash":"ff8e6d99e0b19077244a019fbf99ef4c10e359a4eaa1c1b629af16d7cd1705c3","originalBytes":2234,"storedBytes":2234,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["laptop","system","screen","budget","cpu","laptops","ram","tasks","user","based","editing","gaming","preferences","price","rate","recommendation","refresh","size","their","type","users","weights","works","best","browsing","each","etc.","how","like","matches","needs.","parameters","portability","prioritizes","programming","responsive","scoring","ssd","storage","these","video","web","adjusts","algorithm","api","available","bars","best-suited","calculate","calculates","circleprogress.js","combines","considering","considers","cpus","criteria","css3","data","dataset.","ddr3","ddr4",